mapping again. When I find her; I'll grab Phiona and head back to base
camp - my main one.

   ...

   Come on... Where are the stairs...?

   ...

   Killed another of these wretched wraiths. This one left a corpse. 

   Hmmm... Can I tin it?

   I try. Nope. Game won't allow me. Although, I'm pretty sure that it
will rot away by the time I get back; I picked it up and stuffed it
into the bag of holding for Phiona...

   ...

   The stairs! Yeeeaaa! 

   Up I go...


- Dungeon level 34: 

   < Asmodeus demands 125 zorkmids for safe passage. >

   !

