to you. But what if it would have been a mindflayer! Now I'm
concerned...

   ...

   < You hear a slurping sound. >

   What's that?

   ...

   Found the stairs!

   < You sense a faint wave of psychic energy. >

   Oh no... I know what THAT means!

   ALERT! Mindflayer alert!

   Located it. It's back the way I came. Near the room where the 'Big
A' accosted me...

   I'm going back. Can't let this thing live. I know where it is now.
I'll kill it while I do. That way, it will be done.

   Gawd... (shudder) I absolutely hate these things...

   ...

   We're now both in the same room. If you want to call it that. It
