   Range is 15... Just have to close for two more...

   A Scrooge picture appears out of thin air next to me!

   < The master lich strikes at your displaced image and misses you!
The master lich casts a spell at thin air! >

   Holy Crap! Step away! Must re-activate the cloak immediately!

   It keeps pace with me!

   < The master lich misses. The master lich points all around and
