   The hell with you! I take a step forward and spit on it's remains.
Try and curse my stuff, eh? That will teach you... Didn't even leave
any booty.

   Now I carefully go over my inventory - again (grumble). It's like
the fifth time I do a complete cursing check with all my stuff (mumble
